msgid "Prices cover supply and installation as quoted. Work outside this quotation is charged as a variation once agreed in writing. Retention, where stated, is released as the contract says. Materials stay ours until they are paid for in full. The customer gives clear access to the site and a place to store materials. A delay caused by others extends the programme by the same time."
